{% raw %}# ggen-legacy Verifier Appliance

This directory is generated by `ggen sync run` from `packs/ggen-legacy-assurance-pack` and `ontology/assurance-program.ttl`.

It compiles the trust model into executable customer-controlled surfaces:

1. bounded claim manifest;
2. customer-owned offline portfolio build;
3. independent verifier checks;
4. customer-hidden challenge admission;
5. exact digest and provenance binding;
6. OpenSSL signature verification and append-only transparency chaining;
7. deterministic three-environment replay contract;
8. testing-authority governance checks;
9. organizational control evidence fields;
10. legal recourse and certificate revocation fields.

Run the real reference rail:

```bash
bash appliance/bin/run-reference-e2e.sh
```

The reference fixture may reach `ALIVE` for its bounded scope. That does not promote the product, repository, external production deployment, or real Sunset Admission.
